{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207240","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1720724001:0":{"text":"악당은 쫓아냈으니 걱정 말아요. 이제 다시는 괴롭히지 못할 거예요.","source_cn":"别怕，坏人已经被我们赶跑了。以后他再也不敢欺负你们了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48D7255EC6DBE5A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720724002:0":{"text":"하지만 두목이... 아, 아니... 그 악당이 다시 돌아오면 어떡해요?","source_cn":"可是……要是老大……不，要是那个坏蛋再回来怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD45B3E84A2D8AD60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720724003:1":{"text":"그, 그럼...","source_cn":"那……那就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6211E4302D0BA8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1720724003":{"text":"그, 그럼...","source_cn":"那……那就……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6211E4302D0BA8DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720724004:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말씀이 맞아요...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDEE50F367B04F4E3","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말씀이 맞아요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 말씀이 맞아요...","variant_male_record_index":"233094","variant_female_record_index":"233095","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720724005:0":{"text":"근위대에게 이 구역 순찰을 강화하라고 할게요. 오늘부터 이 골목은 이 공주... 아니, 제가 지켜줄 테니까 안심하세요!","source_cn":"我……我会通知守备军加强这片区域的巡逻。从今天起，这片...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62B08B7C3D9AEA5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720724006:1":{"text":"만약 그 사람이 다시 온다면 로완에게 다리를 부러뜨리라고 할게요!","source_cn":"他要是敢回来，我就让罗万再揍他一次，打断他的腿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5A5A10273C4C78C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720724007:1":{"text":"잠깐, 왜 또 그런 험한 일을 저한테 떠넘기는 건데요? 에휴... 뭐 좋아요, 이번엔 특별히 자발적 야근을 하는 셈 치죠.","source_cn":"喂喂，打人的活儿怎么又归我了？不过……这次算我自愿加班。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CE343313527AE5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720724008:0":{"text":"고마워요, 착한 언니... 아까 속여서 미안했어요...","source_cn":"谢谢你，好心的姐姐……对不起，我骗了你……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDF6AF61629CE0E55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720724009:0":{"text":"사실 아픈 여동생 같은 건 없어요. 저희는 고아라서 집이 없거든요...","source_cn":"我家里……根本没有生病的妹妹。我和汤姆，还有大家，都是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x934AE868782F3ECA","variant_sta